1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Your agents write reports about work they did. This keeps the receipt.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Seats and spend are visible. What the agents actually did is not.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Open the hold console — a held claim opens back to the session.
None of them holds the transcript.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Watch ./demo.sh — a stranger catches a false claim with no account and no network.

5
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Pull request one — verify-claims goes red on deadbee.
Record H-57b130f397 — traceable, by design.

6
00:01:38,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Four verdicts: PASS, BLOCK, UNVERIFIABLE, HOLD — the gate never runs a command from a report.

7
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:35,000
78,618 messages audited — 41.7 raw, 8.1 corrected; our probe error.
Gemini explains; Python decides.
